      "trajectory": [
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 1,
          "segmentText": "# EP5-2 — 回復の道（半歩）\n- POV: 私（Tamaki／環樹）\n- Beat: Verdict / Aftermath\n\n判決は半歩だけ前に進んだ。私は拳を握りたくなる衝動を、呼吸でほどく。応報ではなく、回復を残す。Neroの匂いがかすかに混ざる。名を問う準備を、私は心の片隅で始めた。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anticipation",
              "score": 1
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anger",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "surprise",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "trust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "disgust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
