            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 4,
          "segmentText": "Aoi「ASCは？」\n私「低め維持。合図で上げる」\nAoi「このタグは残す？」\n私「うん。誰かが帰って来られる目印になる」\n掃除とは、戻れる道を残すこと。朝のアナウンスが流れ、街の騒音が半歩だけ下がった。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0.3333
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0.3333
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0.3333
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0
