        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 1,
          "segmentText": "# EP12-1 — Together（いっしょに）\n- POV: 私（Tamaki／環樹）\n- Beat: Collective Release / Quiet Union\n\n```json\n{\n  \"@context\": {\n    \"@base\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/\",\n    \"gh\": \"https://ghosthacker.junkawasaki.com/gh#\",\n    \"antagonist\": { \"@id\": \"gh:antagonist\", \"@type\": \"@id\" },\n    \"character\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/character/\",\n    \"ghost\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/ghost/\"\n  },",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "trust",
              "score": 1
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
